<title>MALAYSIA: MAS to announce earnings on Thursday.</title>
<headline>MAS to announce earnings on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia Airline System Bhd (MAS) said it would announce its earnings for 1996/97 year at 5 p.m. local time (0900 GMT) on Thursday.</p>
<p>In a statement, the national carrier said MAS chairman Tajudin Ramli would release the results at its headquarters.</p>
<p>The Estimate Directory, which polled 31 analysts covering the stock, projects net profit to be 261 million ringgit for the year ended March 31, 1997. MAS reported net profit of 233 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
